      "id": "claim_11379925704a4f14b3cba48a4ea06048",
      "statement": "Configuration is loaded lazily: the first access to app.conf or a pending configuration key runs _load_config, which sends on_configure, imports the config source through the loader, builds Settings via detect_settings, applies pending defaults and periodic tasks, and sends on_after_configure.",
