      "statement": "finalize() is guarded by an RLock, announces finalization (running built-in and shared task constructors), evaluates pending task proxies, re-binds all tasks, and sends on_after_finalize; accessing app.tasks triggers finalize(auto=True), which raises RuntimeError when autofinalize=False.",
